  {
   "id": "fear-the-timeloop-318266@1.0.9",
   "gameId": "fear-the-timeloop-318266",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.9",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-08T19:30:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, I want to say a huge thank you to everyone who keeps helping make the game better by sharing feedback and reviews. You’re amazing. Truly. And even if you don’t write feedback, you’re still amazing. Always.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Now, let’s get to what’s new in this update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with the final puzzle when using a controller;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that allowed the clown to leave the playable area;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the final boss fight: small spiders and the second-phase boss are now slower;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The second-phase of the last boss deals less damage;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed collision issues at the hospital entrance and in the final location;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where save files could fail to appear;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimized enemies, chapter 8 should no longer tank performance;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues with achievements unlocking for maximum inventory slots and collecting all files;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem that caused save files to grow excessively in size;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with drawing the baton after sprinting;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed healing items stack issue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all for now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, thank you all for your support, and have a great day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
