  {
   "id": "fear-the-timeloop-318266@1.0.6",
   "gameId": "fear-the-timeloop-318266",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.6",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-03T02:09:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "So, here’s a patch that improves boss behavior, makes the final fight easier, and also smooths out other gameplay moments. Below is the list of changes we’ve made:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The pursuer boss is now slightly slower;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final boss now deals reduced damage;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the achievement for completing all radio conversations;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed achievements not unlocking on Hardcore difficulty;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased hitboxes in the second phase of the final boss;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added blood effects when hitting enemies with the baton;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed double-barrel shotgun reloading;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the ammo stack size for the shotgun;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the weak spot size in the first and second phases of the final boss;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all for now. Thank you very much to everyone who leaves feedback. I’m aware of the issues that haven’t been resolved yet, and I will definitely fix them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
