  {
   "id": "fear-the-timeloop-318266@1.0.4",
   "gameId": "fear-the-timeloop-318266",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-02T01:08:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! First of all, a huge thank you for leaving feedback. As I mentioned before, I’m doing my best to fix everything you don’t like in order to improve your overall gameplay experience. Now, here’s the list of changes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the baton attack animation speed;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the baton’s damage;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a random difficulty mode switching issue;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the hand station in the surgeon’s room;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the option to enable or disable smooth camera movement and rotation;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a levers-related soft lock; even if it already happened to you, it will now be fixed automatically, no need to replay that part;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a soft lock in the catacombs;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the toilet door with the red lollipop;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed baton damage on the No Loop difficulty;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all for now. In the next update, we’ll be working on the first and final bosses, as well as improving game optimization. Many thanks to all the players and everyone who’s interested in the project. Good luck, and have a great day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
